# Human gates

These are files, not chat confirmations.

1. `FACT_APPROVED` — research spine is sourced. Required before script.
2. `NARRATION_LOCKED` — VO was listened to. Required before storyboard.
3. `PUBLISH_GO` — human intends to upload. Publish stage still refuses to implement social posting.

Never skip. Never auto-publish.
